    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061209.0223\n\nRAMALLAH,  West Bank, Dec 9 , 2006, 2006\n\nPalestinian leadership urges early elections\n\n\n\n\nThe executive committee of the Palestine Liberation Organization recommended Saturday that Palestinian president Mahmud Abbas call early parliamentary and presidential elections to resolve a spiraling political crisis, committee members said.\n\n\"The exectuive committee, chaired by Abbas, decided to call on Abbas to hold early parliamentary and presidential elections,\" executive committee member Saleh Rafaat told AFP.",
